{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Partner API",
    "version": "0.1.13",
    "description": "The routes an integration partner uses to start a case for an applicant, follow it, and read its facts.\n\n**Authentication.** Every route takes the organization's API key in the `X-API-Key` header. The key belongs to one organization and decides which organization a request acts for. Do not send an `Authorization` header: when present it is read instead of the key, and these routes then refuse the request.\n\n**Two names for one id.** A case id is called `case_id` when a case is created and `inquiry_id` everywhere else. They are the same value.\n\n**Facts, not ratings.** The result reports what was verified, what is pending, who vouched and what they said, and what happened when. It carries no score, zone, recommendation or confidence.\n\n**Errors.** Every error body has a `code` from a closed list, a `message` for people, and on a field error a `field`. Branch on the HTTP status first and the code second, and treat a code you do not know by its status. Some error bodies also carry older fields (`error`, `statusCode`); they are not part of the contract.\n\n**Retries.** Retry a 429 after `retry_after_seconds`. Retry a 500 INTERNAL_ERROR with the same request a few times with backoff. Do not retry any other error unchanged. Creating a case is safe to retry: the application id makes a repeat return the same case.\n\n**Limits.** 1000 requests a minute per organization key.\n\n**Versioning.** The result carries `schema_version`; see its description. Fields not listed in this document may appear in responses: ignore them."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.digavouch.com"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Cases"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/digavouch/v1/intake/applications": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createCaseFromApplication",
        "summary": "Create a case from an application",
        "tags": [
          "Cases"
        ],
        "description": "Sends one application from your system. The first time an application id is seen, a case is created and the applicant is invited (201). Sending the same application id again with the same email address returns the same case (200) and invites nobody, so a request that timed out can be retried as it is.\n\nHow the applicant is reached is the organization's setting: an email from us, the link in this response (`verification_link`), or both. The link is in the 201 only. If the organization takes the link in the response and a 201 is lost in transit, the retry's 200 carries no link: issue a fresh applicant link for the case instead.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrgSelection"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IntakeApplicationRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "This application id already has a case for this email address. `outcome` is `existing`; nothing was created, nobody was invited, and there is no link.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IntakeApplicationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "A new case. The applicant is invited, or the link is in the body, as the organization chose.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "description": "`no-store` when the body carries `verification_link`.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IntakeApplicationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A field is missing or invalid (INVALID_REQUEST, with `field`: `body`, `application_id`, `job_id`, `candidate` or `candidate.email`), or the `X-DigaVouch-Org` header is present but is not an organization id (ORG_SELECTION_INVALID).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "INVALID_REQUEST",
                            "ORG_SELECTION_INVALID"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No `X-API-Key` header, or the key is not valid.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "INVALID_AUTH"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "A person's login was sent instead of an API key (API_KEY_REQUIRED), or the `X-DigaVouch-Org` header names an organization this key is not for (ORG_SELECTION_FORBIDDEN).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "API_KEY_REQUIRED",
                            "ORG_SELECTION_FORBIDDEN"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "This application id already has a case for a different email address (APPLICATION_EMAIL_MISMATCH), or its case was deleted by the organization and is not recreated (CASE_DELETED). Nothing was created.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "APPLICATION_EMAIL_MISMATCH",
                            "CASE_DELETED"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "The body is larger than 1 MB.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "INVALID_REQUEST"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "415": {
            "description": "The body is not `application/json`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "INVALID_REQUEST"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "The organization has not mapped this job and does not accept unmapped jobs. The job is recorded for the organization; no case was created.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "UNMAPPED_JOB"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests: more than 1000 a minute for this organization's key, or 300 a minute from one address without a valid key. Wait `retry_after_seconds` (the same value as the `Retry-After` header), then retry the same request.",
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "description": "Seconds to wait before retrying.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Limit": {
                "description": "Requests allowed in the window.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Remaining": {
                "description": "Requests left in the window.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Reset": {
                "description": "Seconds until the window resets.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "The organization's account is missing a setting this job needs (NO_DEFAULT_CAMPAIGN): retrying does not help, contact support. Or an unexpected error (INTERNAL_ERROR): retry the same request a few times with backoff. A body that is not valid JSON also returns INTERNAL_ERROR today: check the body before retrying.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PartnerError"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "enum": [
                            "NO_DEFAULT_CAMPAIGN",
                            "INTERNAL_ERROR"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
